    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "last time i went to the er for something minor they just sat me in a waiting room for 5 hours only to tell me i was fine. it's such a waste of time and money when i literally feel okay. could i just take some extra ibuprofen or something to help with the headache and then just stay awake for a few hours to make sure i don't feel worse? seems safer than sitting in a hospital all night if i'm actually fine.",
